flowchart LR
  Dev["Developer or agent"]
  Validator["Deterministic local boundary validator"]
  Policy["Canonical storage, boundary, and incident policies"]
  Local["Non-installing redacted scan wrapper"]
  Scanner["Integrity-verified Gitleaks"]
  Workflow["Read-only Guardian workflow"]
  Result["Redacted status and scoped evidence"]
  Exception["Historical exception register"]
  Approval["Human owner decision gate"]

  Dev --> Validator
  Validator --> Policy
  Dev --> Local
  Local --> Scanner
  Workflow --> Scanner
  Scanner --> Result
  Result --> Exception
  Exception --> Approval
  Approval -. no autonomous mutation .-> Policy
